    "backstory": "Born in the toxic swamps on the edge of Subchain City, Wacker was raised in a family of scrappers. They made their living salvaging tech and gear from the ruins of the old world, always one step ahead of the rival gangs. One fateful day, while salvaging a cache of locked jaw beaks, their camp was raided, leaving Wacker the only survivor.",
